      "message": "Do we really need to assert the *exact* number of evictions?\n\nP.S. The magic value `3` was out of sync with the comment before: which one was the right one? Why `3` and not `2`? Why `2` and not `1`?\n\nIf we just want to assert that has been evicted, then just asserting that the number of missCount is higher than initialNumMisses should suffice? @maczech@gmail.com WDYT?",
