      "writtenOn": "2025-02-22T19:15:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In line #148 there is first check with `+1` and then new project is created that results in extra `2` misses hence the value `3`. IOW `3` here means extra `2` since the last check...\nI have restored the original order of the events firing in the `ProjectCreator` hence the change was reverted back to `3`.\n\nThe open question is if we should actually change this order too IOW invalidate the projects cache prior sending `project-created` and `ref-updated` events but that, if `true`, should be IMHO a subject of the follow-up so that not too many changes are mixed in a single commit. @luca.milanesio@gmail.com, @maczech@gmail.com WDYT?",
